│ negatively influence long-term growth."}, {"study_index": 92, "title": "Effectiveness of a multi‐component           │
│ intervention for overweight and obese children (Nereu Program): a randomized controlled trial", "abstract":          │
│ "INTRODUCTION Treatment of childhood obesity is a complex challenge for primary health care professionals.           │
