│ vs control change: 0.83 to 0.83 vs 0.82 to 0.84, respectively; adjusted difference, -0.02 [95% CI, -0.03 to -0.01];  │
│ P<.001). Relative to controls, intervention group changes were accompanied by statistically significant decreases in │
