│ the method can be adapted to many other countries. REGISTRY OF PROTOCOL Protocol registered on the site              │
│ ensaiosclinicos.gov.br: RBR-8ttw64."}, {"study_index": 97, "title": "The effects of a weight loss program focusing   │
│ on maternal education on childhood obesity", "abstract": "PURPOSE Childhood obesity is a matter of great concern     │
│ because of its negative health and social consequences. We examined the effect of a weight control program focusing  │
