│ effects. RESULTS After the intervention was completed, the level of self-control was significantly heightened and    │
│ obesity levels in the other three outcomes were greatly lowered in the experimental group when compared with the     │
│ control group. CONCLUSION Due to strong maternal effects on children\'s weight control, mothers\' active             │
│ participation must be encouraged in order to resolve childhood obesity."}, {"study_index": 98, "title": "Effect of   │
│ physical exercise on bodyweight in overweight children: a randomized controlled trial in a Brazilian slum",          │
│ "abstract": "Given the increase in obesity in developed and developing countries and its concomitant morbidity,      │
│ successful treatment approaches are needed. We examined the effect of a structured exercise intervention in          │
│ overweight children in a slum in Recife, Pernambuco State, Brazil. This was a randomized, controlled efficacy trial. │
