│ {"study_index": 100, "title": "Predicting obesity in young adulthood from childhood and parental obesity",           │
│ "abstract": "BACKGROUND Childhood obesity increases the risk of obesity in adulthood, but how parental obesity       │
│ affects the chances of a child\'s becoming an obese adult is unknown. We investigated the risk of obesity in young   │
│ adulthood associated with both obesity in childhood and obesity in one or both parents. METHODS Height and weight    │
