  intervention plus final control. Main outcome measures were: change in lifestyle habits, and of BMI and waist         
  circumference (WC).Results: mean (SD) age was 11.81 (1.21) and 50% were female. A total of 125 participants (71.8%)   
  completed follow-up at 12 months. Body mass index Z-scores showed a significant reduction in both study groups (p<    
